@anon.c8777b812d6b35c09a8e6156f259107b.569 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [612 x i8] }> <{ [612 x i8] c"Require a matching hash for each requirement.\0A\0AHash-checking mode is all or nothing. If enabled, _all_ requirements must be provided\0Awith a corresponding hash or set of hashes. Additionally, if enabled, _all_ requirements\0Amust either be pinned to exact versions (e.g., `==1.0.0`), or be specified via direct URL.\0A\0AHash-checking mode introduces a number of additional constraints:\0A\0A- Git dependencies are not supported.\0A- Editable installs are not supported.\0A- Local dependencies are not supported, unless they point to a specific wheel (`.whl`) or\0A  source archive (`.zip`, `.tar.gz`), as opposed to a directory." }>, align 1
