@anon.c8777b812d6b35c09a8e6156f259107b.581 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [521 x i8] }> <{ [521 x i8] c"The backend to use when fetching packages in the PyTorch ecosystem.\0A\0AWhen set, uv will ignore the configured index URLs for packages in the PyTorch ecosystem,\0Aand will instead use the defined backend.\0A\0AFor example, when set to `cpu`, uv will use the CPU-only PyTorch index; when set to `cu126`,\0Auv will use the PyTorch index for CUDA 12.6.\0A\0AThe `auto` mode will attempt to detect the appropriate PyTorch index based on the currently\0Ainstalled CUDA drivers.\0A\0AThis option is in preview and may change in any future release." }>, align 1
